{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our naproxen supply to multiple Glenmark plants with OAI classifications and warning letters within the past three years",
  "headline_cites": ["E4", "E6", "E12", "E13", "E20", "E22"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Our naproxen product (NDC 68462018805) lists three Glenmark manufacturing sites on its label: Glenmark Pharmaceuticals Inc., USA (FEI 3011585599), Glenmark Pharmaceuticals Limited at Colvale, India (FEI 3008565058), and Glenmark Pharmaceuticals Limited at Pithampur, India (FEI 3004672766).",
      "cites": ["E7", "E14", "E23"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The US site received an OAI classification on 2022-05-19 and a Warning Letter on 2023-06-20, while its most recent inspection on 2025-06-17 was VAI.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E6", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Colvale, India site received an OAI classification on 2025-02-14 and a Warning Letter on 2025-07-11.",
      "cites": ["E12", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Pithampur, India site received an OAI classification on 2022-05-20 and a Warning Letter on 2022-11-22, with its most recent inspection on 2026-06-30 classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E20", "E22", "E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Three Class II recalls for naproxen products manufactured by these Glenmark sites have been initiated since 2021, including two ongoing recalls from 2023-11-07 and 2025-03-13 for labeling mix-ups and CGMP deviations.",
      "cites": ["E24", "E26", "E27"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory shows 19 days on hand at Corvale East and 14 days at Corvale General.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to purchase from Teva Pharmaceuticals, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list and uses Actavis Labs FL Inc. as its manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
